US government records
  Answer-key values for public companies are taken from SEC EDGAR filings, and for private companies from the US
  Department of Labor's PERM disclosure data and Form 5500 filings. Metro areas are the US Census Bureau's Core Based
  Statistical Areas. These are works of the US federal government; the quotes from them are included to cite the
  source of each value.

Company websites
  Quotes and short descriptions taken from companies' own websites (the "quote" and "description" fields in
  company_enrichment/gt/) remain the property of those companies. They are included only to show where each
  answer-key value comes from.

LinkedIn industry list
  company_enrichment/gt/linkedin_industries.json lists LinkedIn's industry codes, names and descriptions, from
  Microsoft Learn: https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/linkedin/shared/references/reference-tables/industry-codes and
  https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/linkedin/shared/references/reference-tables/industry-codes-v2.
  LinkedIn is a trademark of LinkedIn Corporation.

